> 
> In the Finnish Louhos project (http://louhos.github.com/en), we are working to collect comprehensive software libraries to analyze society and decision-making processes based on publicly available data resources. Our project aims to combine latest advances in data analysis to up-to-date data resources and to provide freely available analytical research tools for academics, NGOs, journalists, citizens, and other target groups. I felt that this project is within the scope of your initiative, therefore wanted to follow your request and send a note. We will be happy to provide further information of the project, if you wish.
